gyboth wrote:
> Does anybody have any ideas how I can circumvent the problem? Can I load the save with some other version of the game? Or can I get nethack to log the error more verbosely?

If you could compile a debugging version of the Mac executable, you
could use a debugger to get a more useful explanation of what went
wrong. Sadly, this is nontrivial if you're not used to compiling code
(but, at least, much easier on Mac than on Windows).

There are instructions on NetHackWiki at
<http://nethackwiki.com/wiki/Compiling>. If you want to create a
debugging version, you need to add -g to the CFLAGS when you change them
in step 6.

